error[E0536]: field 'most' of a fields-only anonymous class cannot be const
 --> $DIR/anonymous-const-field.nra:2:33
  |
2 | let limits: class (export const most: int = 10;) = new;
  |                                 ^^^^ declared with 'const'
  |
  = note: 'new' gives the fields of a fields-only anonymous class their values after it allocates the object, and only a class's own field initializers can give a const field its value
  = help: declare the field with 'let', or declare a named class for the shape

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0536`.
